<h3>Application of Activated Carbon Panel Filters</h3>
<ul>
<li>Pre-filtration of air conditioning and ventilation system to avoid ash pollution inside the system.</li>
<li>Pre-filtration of large air compressors.</li>
<li>Clean room centralized ventilation and air conditioning system and return air system to extend the service life of the back-end hepa filters.</li>
<li>The ventilation system of ordinary industrial plants,let its meet the general clean demand of air.</li>
<li>General building building air conditioning coarse dust filtration system.</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h3>Philite® Specializes in High-quality Flat Air Filters</h3>
<p>Our filtration products have passed SGS and ISO9001 certification and are exported to Europe, North America, Southeast Asia, Africa and other regions. With our emphasis on quality and after-sales service, we have won a good reputation in the filtration industry.</p>
